    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153600/extras/85819596ded8b9416c13e6c32bd99e76.avif?t=1682627256\" /></div><br>Hero Jumper is a sandbox first-person shooter game, where you can break every single object to its smallest parts. Destroy enemies that try to kill you on the wild map. Or download maps from the workshop.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153600/extras/e214762a6a8d20557b88a492f05ac6ab.poster.avif?t=1682627256\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153600/extras/e214762a6a8d20557b88a492f05ac6ab.webm?t=1682627256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153600/extras/e214762a6a8d20557b88a492f05ac6ab.mp4?t=1682627256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li>Procedural Destruction<br> </li><li>First Person Shooter<br> </li><li>Level Editor (Scripting Support)<br> </li><li>Workshop Downloading/Uploading</li></ul>",
